#
# File: 500-NFS-udp-dports-out-request-DROP.rule
# Policy: DENY local NFS client request to remote NFS server

udp sport 111 counter drop comment "local-to-remote NFSportmapper/UDP/111 request"
udp sport 2049 counter drop comment "local-to-remote NFS/UDP/2049 request"
udp sport 20048 counter drop comment "local-to-remote NFSmountd/UDP/20048 request"
